      "start_seconds": 273.77,
      "end_seconds": 288.27,
      "duration_seconds": 14.5,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a likely anterior cruciate ligament tear, but I'd like to confirm. I'll request an MRI of the knee, it'll help with knee injury"
    },
