      "start_seconds": 292.65,
      "end_seconds": 311.87,
      "duration_seconds": 19.22,
      "text": "I'm sending you for an X-ray of the knee because of knee injury rest, ice and elevation, and use crutches until the scan a short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think book a review after the scan"
